					<textBox width="11" height="1">Request vacuum from vacuum set when either reloader is about to start vacuum
    <objPosition posX="0" posY="134"></objPosition>
					</textBox>
					<textBox width="11" height="1">Assign valve commands
    <objPosition posX="0" posY="22"></objPosition>
					</textBox>
					<textBox width="8" height="1">By stop discharge eerste de purge even open<objPosition posX="0" posY="0"></objPosition>
					</textBox>
					<textBox width="11" height="1">Purge 1
    <objPosition posX="0" posY="141"></objPosition>
					</textBox>
					<textBox width="11" height="1">Alarm Setpoint Low needs higher...
    <objPosition posX="0" posY="170"></objPosition>
					</textBox>
					<textBox width="11" height="1">Set buzzer when an alarm comes up. the buzzer can be reset by pressing reset
