					</textBox>
					<textBox width="11" height="1">Reset reloader set commands when manual mode is activated
    <objPosition posX="0" posY="7"></objPosition>
					</textBox>
					<textBox width="6" height="1">Keep AirSupply ReloaderA open when AirSupply ReloaderB is still closed<objPosition posX="14" posY="61"></objPosition>
					</textBox>
					<textBox width="2" height="1">Valve V10
    <objPosition posX="18" posY="26"></objPosition>
					</textBox>
